      "en": "“Enlarge the place of your tent, and let them stretch out the curtains of your habitations; don’t spare; lengthen your cords, and strengthen your stakes.",
      "ko": "네 장막터를 넓히며 네 처소의 휘장을 아끼지 말고 널리 펴되 너의 줄을 길게 하며 너의 말뚝을 견고히 할찌어다",
      "source_text_hash": "64a9928466ffaf4f28f0f0bab659b2f334ee28d7c216f4cf70b9beca98453c4f",
      "translation_text_hash": "d691f456c8e77644fbb38ac98f344a061f8e6ea5f72c1afb51e5ead91b3c9fcc",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
